{"unit_id":"OzzyDeng-JunDeng__dsh-keyless-search#card-zh","repo":"OzzyDeng-JunDeng/dsh-keyless-search","commit":"94c574bf0c0997656a94f0024851cb2b81bbd18e","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-keyless-search 是一个面向 DSH Web 客户端的网页搜索插件：它把 keyless-search 注册到 DSH 的 web 搜索服务，并通过配置补丁将内置 web_search 指向该提供方。默认依次查询 Tavily 和 Firecrawl，取首个非空结果；也可选择 Bing RSS 或 HTML 后端，并设置超时与调试日志。插件将搜索结果整理为标题、链接和摘要，供 DSH 搜索工具呈现。适合希望在 DSH 中进行网页检索、又不打算预先配置搜索 API 密钥的用户。安装需要把插件加入 DSH profile；默认查询发送给 Tavily 或 Firecrawl。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:397-435","lib/index.js:551-579","lib/index.js:592-615","cordis.patch.yml:6-22"]}
{"unit_id":"OzzyDeng-JunDeng__dsh-keyless-search#card-en","repo":"OzzyDeng-JunDeng/dsh-keyless-search","commit":"94c574bf0c0997656a94f0024851cb2b81bbd18e","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-keyless-search adds web search to DSH by registering a provider for its web service. It tries Tavily and Firecrawl in order, with optional Bing backends. Timeouts and debug logging are configurable. Add it to a DSH profile; searches are sent to the selected provider.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:397-435","lib/index.js:551-579","lib/index.js:592-615","cordis.patch.yml:6-22"]}
