{"unit_id":"OzzyDeng-JunDeng__dsh-keyless-search#feature-1","repo":"OzzyDeng-JunDeng/dsh-keyless-search","commit":"94c574bf0c0997656a94f0024851cb2b81bbd18e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-keyless-search 的功能「免密网页搜索」：把 DSH 的 web_search 接到 Tavily 与 Firecrawl 搜索后端，按配置顺序查询并返回首个非空结果。由 DSH profile 加载插件后自动生效。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:397-435","lib/index.js:551-579","cordis.patch.yml:12-22"]}
{"unit_id":"OzzyDeng-JunDeng__dsh-keyless-search#feature-2","repo":"OzzyDeng-JunDeng/dsh-keyless-search","commit":"94c574bf0c0997656a94f0024851cb2b81bbd18e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-keyless-search 的功能「搜索提供方回退」：按 searchBackends 配置逐个查询，忽略空结果或失败并尝试后续后端；全部失败时返回包含各后端原因的错误。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:551-579"]}
{"unit_id":"OzzyDeng-JunDeng__dsh-keyless-search#feature-3","repo":"OzzyDeng-JunDeng/dsh-keyless-search","commit":"94c574bf0c0997656a94f0024851cb2b81bbd18e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-keyless-search 的功能「可选 Bing 搜索」：可在后端配置中选择 RSS 或 HTML 解析方式，并设置 Bing 主机和市场参数；这两个后端不在默认列表中。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:438-488","lib/index.js:41-53"]}
{"unit_id":"OzzyDeng-JunDeng__dsh-keyless-search#feature-4","repo":"OzzyDeng-JunDeng/dsh-keyless-search","commit":"94c574bf0c0997656a94f0024851cb2b81bbd18e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-keyless-search 的功能「搜索超时与诊断」：每次后端请求应用可配置的超时；可启用调试日志记录服务来源，并在失败时保留后端错误原因。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:364-390","lib/index.js:592-598","lib/index.js:551-579"]}
{"unit_id":"OzzyDeng-JunDeng__dsh-keyless-search#caveat-1","repo":"OzzyDeng-JunDeng/dsh-keyless-search","commit":"94c574bf0c0997656a94f0024851cb2b81bbd18e","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-keyless-search 使用默认后端时会把搜索词发送到 Tavily 或 Firecrawl 的搜索接口；设置密钥时也会随请求发送对应凭据（见 lib/index.js:397-424）。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:397-424"]}
